    "Question #: 6": {
      "Title": "Exam JN0-680 topic 1 question 42 discussion - ExamTopics",
      "Question": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "You are building a DCI solution and need both a Layer 2 solution and a Later 3 solution for different workloads within your data centers."
          },
          {
            "type": "break"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "What are two reasons why MPLS would be used a transport for this DCI solution? (Choose two.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Choices": {
        "A": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "A. The fast failover capabilities of MPLS nodes can be accomplished in a recovery time that is equivalent to 50 ms or better."
            }
          ]
        },
        "B": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "B. MPLS allows you to natively runnel your own Layer 2 traffic through the service provided L3VPN."
            }
          ]
        },
        "C": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "C. MPLS allows you to interconnect multiple data centers over a public IP network."
            }
          ]
        },
        "D": {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "value": "D. MPLS allows for any-to-any connectivity allowing for both Layer 2 and Layer 3 DCIs."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "Answer": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Suggested Answer: BD \ud83d\uddf3\ufe0f"
          }
        ]
      },
      "Explanation": {
        "content": []
      },
      "Vote_count": []
